    "intro_narrative": "You wake up in the dimly lit underground server room of the enigmatic Blackwood Corporation. The air hums with the sound of cooling fans, and blinking LEDs cast long, unnatural shadows across the concrete floor. You've broken in to uncover the truth behind their illegal surveillance operations, but the facility's automated systems have locked down the sector. The main blast doors are sealed, and your only way out is to retrieve the master keycard hidden deep within their encrypted network. You will need to navigate a complex maze of biometric locks, cryptographic modules, and encrypted servers to piece together the necessary override protocols. Time is running out before the night guards complete their rounds.",
